  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000szq0](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000szq0) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 57.099 depth occurred on Jul 11 2026 43km S of Sarangani. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 5.0334 longitude 125.4897. It impacted 34058 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
